  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">GEO: Understanding Heritage: Regional activities</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To address the gap in the education system, the National Trust of Georgia (NTG) is launching a creative and inclusive educational initiative aimed at raising awareness about the significance of heritage and environmental conservation among children and youth in Tbilisi and selected regions, Kvemo Kartli and Imereti.
Overall, the project promotes democratic change, social development, and a deeper understanding of environmental and cultural heritage, thereby supporting sustainable development.</narrative>
  </description>
